Column 07: E - Path Field Strength (dB(1uV/m))
Column 08: SNR - Median signal-to-noise ratio (dB)
Column 09: Dominant mode
Column 10: Dominant mode - Elevation angle (deg)
Column 11: Dominant mode - Delay (mS)
