Column 13: Dominant mode - Propagation probability (%)
Column 14: Dominant mode - Virtual height (km)
Column 15: Dominant mode - Median received power (dB)
Column 16: Dominant mode - Receiver Antenna Gain (dBi)
Column 17: Dominant mode - Field Strength (dB(1uV/m))
Column 18: Dominant mode - Basic MUF (MHz)

************************** End Data Format ********************************

